    {
      "id": "p0121-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Japanese, Snowdrake speaks using a dialect associated with Osaka, the comedy capital of Japan. Snowdrake also uses the pronoun wate, which reinforces his connection to Osaka-style comedy.",
